                        <msItem xml:id="ms_i7">
                            <locus target="#1v"/>
                            <title type="complete" xml:lang="gez" ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT7846Prayer">Ṣalot baʾǝnta maftǝḥe śǝrāy</title>
                            <textLang mainLang="gez"/>
                            <incipit xml:lang="gez">
                                በስመ፡ አብ፡ <gap reason="ellipsis" resp="bm:GrebTiss1935Codices"/> ጸሎት፡ <supplied reason="omitted">በእንተ፡</supplied> መፍትሔ፡ ሥራይ፡ 
                                በ፲ወ፪ወርኅ፡ በዘ<supplied reason="omitted">፡</supplied> ደገመ፡ በ፯ዕለታት፡ በ፲ወ፪ሐዋርያት፡ በ፸ወ፪አርድዕት፡ ፍታሕ፡ በጻድቃን፡ ወሰማዕት፡ ደናግል፡
                                ወመነኮሳት፡ አእሩግ፡ ወሕፃናት፡ ፍታሕ፡
                            </incipit>
                            <explicit xml:lang="gez">
                                በሰኑይ፡ ወበሰሉስ፡ በረቡዕ፡ ወበሐሙስ፡ በዓርብ<supplied reason="omitted">፡</supplied> 
                                በ<choice><corr resp="bm:GrebTiss1935Codices">ቀ</corr><sic>ቅ</sic></choice>ዳሚት፡ በሰንበተ፡ ክርስቲያን፡ ፍታሕ፡ ለገብርከ፡ 
                                <persName role="owner" ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS15336WaldaKi">ወልደ<supplied reason="omitted">፡</supplied> ኪዳን፡</persName>
                            </explicit>
                        </msItem>
                        <msItem xml:id="ms_i8">
                            <locus target="#1v"/>
                            <title type="complete" xml:lang="gez" ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT7847Prayer">Ṣalot baʾǝnta dama nǝsr wa-nǝzāz</title>
                            <textLang mainLang="gez"/>
                            <note>The following is the entire text.</note>
                            <incipit xml:lang="gez">
                                በስመ፡ አብ፡ <gap reason="ellipsis" resp="bm:GrebTiss1935Codices"/> ጸሎት፡ በእንተ፡ ደመ፡ <supplied reason="lost">ን</supplied>ስር፡ ወንዛዝ፡ ፋሎክ፡
