                            <note>The following is the entire text.</note>
                            <incipit xml:lang="gez">
                                በስመ፡ አብ፡ <gap reason="ellipsis" resp="bm:GrebTiss1935Codices"/> ጸሎት፡ በእንተ፡ ሕማመ<supplied reason="omitted">፡</supplied> ንዛዝ፡ 
